The challenge of a French school to improve their english reading comprehension skills.
To develop an activity for the teachers to give them some practical methods on how to approach students through reading books and teaching materials;
To find out if there are real differences between these groups in this subject;
In order to take into account what teachers can offer students when it comes to reading books like comics;
For them also to be able to read quickly both inside a book or at home.
